    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Hatch Your very own slime!</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take care of your slime as it eats, grows, and evolves into new forms. Feed it, clean it, train it, and watch it level up! From a tiny blob to a powerful companion, your slime\u2019s journey is in your hands!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Features:</strong></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Start with a baby slime and raise it through multiple evolution stages</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > Feed, clean, and play to keep your slime happy</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Train your slime to earn XP and unlock powerful new forms (depending on care it receives)</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Are you ready to raise the ultimate slime?</p>",
